{"headword":"מָהַר","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb.</strong> hasten <strong>(</strong>NH Pi., and deriv.; Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">مَهَرَ</span> <em>be practised, skilled</em> (with Assyrian <em>mâru</em>, <em>send, order, govern</em>, cf. ii. <a data-ref=\"BDB, מהר\" href=\"/BDB,_מהר\", dir=\"rtl\">מהר</a>); Ethiopic መሀረ <em>train, teach;</em> Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܡܗܪ</span> Pa. <em>id.;</em> cf. also Egypt. <em>māhar</em>, <em>trained warrior</em> Bondi <sup>57</sup><strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִמְהָ֑רָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 5:13\" href=\"/Job.5.13\">Jb 5:13</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִמְהָר</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:6\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.6\">Hb 1:6</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִמְהָרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.4\">Is 32:4</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִמְהֲרֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 35:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.35.4\">Is 35:4</a>;—<em>be hurried</em> = anxious, disturbed <span dir=\"rtl\">נִמְהֲרֵי־לֵב</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 35:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.35.4\">Is 35:4</a>; <em>hasty, precipitate</em>, subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵצָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 5:13\" href=\"/Job.5.13\">Jb 5:13</a>; so pt. as subst. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.4\">Is 32:4</a>; <em>impetuous</em>, of Chaldeans, <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:6\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.6\">Hb 1:6</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מַר</span>)."}],"form":"Niph."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִהַר</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.14\">1 S 4:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.14\">Is 51:14</a>; 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִהֲרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.16\">Je 48:16</a> etc.; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְמַהֵר</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.19\">Is 5:19</a> + 2 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְמַהֵר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:6\" href=\"/Genesis.18.6\">Gn 18:6</a> + 8 times (<a data-ref=\"I Samuel 28:20\" href=\"/I_Samuel.28.20\">1 S 28:20</a> v. infr.); 3 fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּמַהֵרְנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 9:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.9.17\">Je 9:17</a> etc.; Imv. ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַהֵר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:22\" href=\"/Genesis.19.22\">Gn 19:22</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַהֲרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 23:27\" href=\"/I_Samuel.23.27\">1 S 23:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22:9\" href=\"/I_Kings.22.9\">1 K 22:9</a>, etc.; Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַהֵר</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 7:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.7.23\">Pr 7:23</a> +; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְמַהֵר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:32\" href=\"/Genesis.41.32\">Gn 41:32</a>; <a data-ref=\"Malachi 3:5\" href=\"/Malachi.3.5\">Mal 3:5</a> (on <span dir=\"rtl\">מַהֵר</span> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 1:14\" href=\"/Zephaniah.1.14\">Zp 1:14</a> [<a data-ref=\"I Samuel 23:22\" href=\"/I_Samuel.23.22\">1 S 23:22</a>] cf. Kö <sup>i. 268</sup>, Schwally<sup> ZAW x. 1890, 176</sup> vid. i. <a data-ref=\"BDB, מַהֵר\" href=\"/BDB,_מַהֵר\", dir=\"rtl\">מַהֵר</a> infra), fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְמַהֲרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.18\">Pr 6:18</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>hasten, make haste</em>, = go or come quickly <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:6\" href=\"/Genesis.18.6\">Gn 18:6</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 9:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.9.12\">1 S 9:12</a> (but del. 𝔊 We Dr Kit Bu HPS), <a data-ref=\"Nahum 2:6\" href=\"/Nahum.2.6\">Na 2:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.17\">Is 49:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.9\">1 Ch 12:9</a>; = go eagerly, (sq. Inf. of purpose) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.16\">Pr 1:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 59:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.59.7\">Is 59:7</a>; Pt. = swift, prompt <a data-ref=\"Malachi 3:5\" href=\"/Malachi.3.5\">Mal 3:5</a>; of bird <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 7:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.7.23\">Pr 7:23</a>; fig. of calamity <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.19\">Is 5:19</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חוּשׁ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.16\">Je 48:16</a>, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַהֵר שָׁלָל חָשׁ בַּז</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.1\">Is 8:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.3\">3</a>, infr."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>hasten</em> + vb., (<span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> having really adverbial force): sq. Inf. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:7\" href=\"/Genesis.18.7\">Gn 18:7</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(מִהַר לַעֲשׂת)</span>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:20\" href=\"/Genesis.27.20\">27:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:32\" href=\"/Genesis.41.32\">41:32</a> (subj. God), <a data-ref=\"Exodus 2:18\" href=\"/Exodus.2.18\">Ex 2:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 10:16\" href=\"/Exodus.10.16\">10:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:33\" href=\"/Exodus.12.33\">12:33</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:14\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.14\">2 S 15:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.4\">Is 32:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.14\">51:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.18\">Pr 6:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 5:1\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.5.1\">Ec 5:1</a>; more often sq. vb. c. ו <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:18\" href=\"/Genesis.24.18\">Gn 24:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:20\" href=\"/Genesis.24.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:46\" href=\"/Genesis.24.46\">46</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 44:11\" href=\"/Genesis.44.11\">44:11</a> (all J), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 45:9\" href=\"/Genesis.45.9\">45:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 45:13\" href=\"/Genesis.45.13\">13</a> (E), prob. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 43:30\" href=\"/Genesis.43.30\">43:30</a> (J), also <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:8\" href=\"/Exodus.34.8\">Ex 34:8</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Joshua 4:10\" href=\"/Joshua.4.10\">Jos 4:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:14\" href=\"/Joshua.8.14\">8:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:19\" href=\"/Joshua.8.19\">19</a> (all JE), <a data-ref=\"Judges 13:10\" href=\"/Judges.13.10\">Ju 13:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.14\">1 S 4:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:48\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.48\">17:48</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 23:27\" href=\"/I_Samuel.23.27\">23:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.18\">25:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:23\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:34\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.34\">34</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 28:24\" href=\"/I_Samuel.28.24\">28:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:14\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.14\">2 S 15:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 19:17\" href=\"/II_Samuel.19.17\">19:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 20:33\" href=\"/I_Kings.20.33\">1 K 20:33</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 20:41\" href=\"/I_Kings.20.41\">41</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.13\">2 K 9:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 9:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.9.17\">Je 9:17</a>; so even when act. is not wholly voluntary <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 28:20\" href=\"/I_Samuel.28.20\">1 S 28:20</a> (but read prob. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּבָּהֵל</span> 𝔊 We Dr Kit Bu); also, ו om., <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:13\" href=\"/Psalms.106.13\">ψ 106:13</a>; especially c. Imv. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:22\" href=\"/Genesis.19.22\">Gn 19:22</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:48\" href=\"/Judges.9.48\">Ju 9:48</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 6:10\" href=\"/Esther.6.10\">Est 6:10</a>; so also <span dir=\"rtl\">מַהֵר עֲנֵנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:18\" href=\"/Psalms.69.18\">ψ 69:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 102:3\" href=\"/Psalms.102.3\">102:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 143:7\" href=\"/Psalms.143.7\">143:7</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 79:8\" href=\"/Psalms.79.8\">79:8</a> (v. Ol<sup>ad loc.</sup>)."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"trans. <em>hasten</em>, = prepare quickly <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:6\" href=\"/Genesis.18.6\">Gn 18:6</a>; = bring quickly <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22:9\" href=\"/I_Kings.22.9\">1 K 22:9</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 18:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.18.8\">2 Ch 18:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Esther 5:5\" href=\"/Esther.5.5\">Est 5:5</a>; = do quickly <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:5\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.5\">2 Ch 24:5</a><sup>(×2)</sup>."}],"num":"3."}],"form":"Pi."}]},"rid":"BDB05131","strong_numbers":["4116","4117"],"next_hw":"מַהֵר","prev_hw":"מַהְפֵּכָה²","all_cited":true,"ordinal":"I.","brackets":"first_word","root":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["4554","4555"],"TWOT":["1152","1153"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}